# Testing

- Keep `npm run verify` green before finishing a change (`npm test` + `npm run typecheck`).
- Prefer unit tests next to pure logic (`electron/**/*.test.ts`, `shared/**/*.test.ts`).
- Cover exported pure builders used by critical paths (e.g. `buildPropertyWrite`, path confinement, allowlist/guard).
- Do not add exploit payloads or attack scripts; defensive tests only.
- Electron is mocked where needed (`electron/activity/test/setup.ts` / vitest aliases) — follow existing patterns.
